{"seq":2,"slug":"finance","title":"金融学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"金融学-简介\">金融学 简介</h1><p>金融学研究资金如何在时间和风险两个维度上被定价、配置和管理。它的核心问题可以浓缩为一句话：一笔未来的现金流，今天值多少钱？围绕这一追问，金融学发展出了从企业融资决策到全球资本市场运行的完整理论体系。</p>\n<p>本知识体系覆盖公司层面的资本运作、投资者视角的资产选择、市场运行机制以及风险控制四大板块，帮助自学者在理论与实务之间建立坚实的桥梁。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>公司金融</strong>探讨企业如何选择最优的资本结构、如何评估投资项目和并购标的的价值，这些决策直接影响企业的生存与增长，是金融学最贴近商业实践的部分。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>投资学</strong>从现代投资组合理论出发，介绍资产定价模型对风险与收益关系的刻画，并引入行为金融学的视角，解释市场中反复出现的非理性现象和定价偏差。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>金融市场</strong>深入股票市场的交易机制、债券市场的利率结构以及衍生品市场的对冲与投机功能，让自学者理解资金在不同市场之间流动的逻辑与规则。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>风险管理</strong>系统梳理金融风险的主要类别、量化度量模型以及保险和对冲等风险转移手段，这些知识对于任何参与金融活动的个人和机构都至关重要。</p>\n<p>建议自学者先从公司金融和投资学建立理论直觉，再进入金融市场了解制度细节，最后学习风险管理将前三章知识综合运用。关注真实的财经案例并尝试用所学模型加以分析，是深化理解的最佳方式。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"corporate-finance","title":"公司金融","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance/corporate-finance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"capital-structure","title":"资本结构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance/corporate-finance/capital-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"valuation-methods","title":"估值方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance/corporate-finance/valuation-methods"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mergers-acquisitions","title":"并购","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance/corporate-finance/mergers-acquisitions"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"investment-theory","title":"投资学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance/investment-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"portfolio-theory","title":"投资组合理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance/investment-theory/portfolio-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"asset-pricing-models","title":"资产定价模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance/investment-theory/asset-pricing-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"behavioral-finance","title":"行为金融","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance/investment-theory/behavioral-finance"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"financial-markets","title":"金融市场","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance/financial-markets","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stock-market-mechanisms","title":"股票市场机制","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance/financial-markets/stock-market-mechanisms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bond-market","title":"债券市场","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance/financial-markets/bond-market"},{"seq":3,"slug":"derivatives-market","title":"衍生品市场","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance/financial-markets/derivatives-market"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"risk-management","title":"风险管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance/risk-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"financial-risk-types","title":"金融风险类型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance/risk-management/financial-risk-types"},{"seq":2,"slug":"risk-measurement-models","title":"风险度量模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance/risk-management/risk-measurement-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"insurance-hedging","title":"保险与对冲","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/finance/risk-management/insurance-hedging"}]}]}